{
  "version": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "multi-agent-dev-001",
    "name": "Multi-Agent Video Page Development",
    "description": "多 Agent 协作开发视频页面"
  },
  "nodes": {
    "node-1": {"id": "node-1", "type": "Input.Text", "version": "1.0", "params": {"text": "开发一个视频播放页面，需要包含视频播放器、播放控制按钮、进度条、音量控制和全屏功能"}},
    "node-2": {"id": "node-2", "type": "Agent.Create", "version": "1.0", "params": {"prompt": "你是项目经理，负责分析需求并制定开发计划。请将需求分解为具体的开发任务，包括：1) HTML结构设计 2) CSS样式设计 3) JavaScript交互开发。对每个任务给出清晰的要求和验收标准。", "provider": "ollama", "model": "qwen3:4b", "temperature": 0.3}},
    "node-3": {"id": "node-3", "type": "Agent.Chat", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
    "node-4": {"id": "node-4", "type": "Agent.Create", "version": "1.0", "params": {"prompt": "你是前端架构师，专注于 HTML 结构设计。根据需求设计语义化的 HTML 结构，使用合适的标签，确保可访问性。只输出 HTML 代码，不要包含 CSS 和 JavaScript。", "provider": "ollama", "model": "qwen3:4b", "temperature": 0.5}},
    "node-5": {"id": "node-5", "type": "Agent.Chat", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
    "node-6": {"id": "node-6", "type": "Agent.Create", "version": "1.0", "params": {"prompt": "你是 UI 设计师，专注于 CSS 样式设计。根据 HTML 结构设计美观、现代的样式。使用 Flexbox 或 Grid 布局，确保响应式设计。只输出 CSS 代码。", "provider": "ollama", "model": "qwen3:4b", "temperature": 0.6}},
    "node-7": {"id": "node-7", "type": "Agent.Chat", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
    "node-8": {"id": "node-8", "type": "Agent.Create", "version": "1.0", "params": {"prompt": "你是交互开发工程师，专注于 JavaScript 功能实现。根据需求实现视频播放控制、进度条、音量控制等交互功能。使用原生 JavaScript，代码要清晰、有注释。只输出 JavaScript 代码。", "provider": "ollama", "model": "qwen3:4b", "temperature": 0.4}},
    "node-9": {"id": "node-9", "type": "Agent.Chat", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
    "node-10": {"id": "node-10", "type": "Agent.Create", "version": "1.0", "params": {"prompt": "你是系统集成工程师，负责将 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 整合成完整的页面。将三部分代码合并成一个完整的 HTML 文件，确保代码格式正确、结构清晰。", "provider": "ollama", "model": "qwen3:4b", "temperature": 0.2}},
    "node-11": {"id": "node-11", "type": "Agent.Chat", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
    "node-12": {"id": "node-12", "type": "Transform.MessagesToText", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
    "node-13": {"id": "node-13", "type": "Output.Text", "version": "1.0", "params": {}},
